  message: "PR #2175 fixes nested brace and package prefix issues. kata-containers now shows 4 implements_rpc edges (CacheService methods). Remaining gaps: (1) ttrpc pattern (RegisterXxxService instead of RegisterXxxServer) — kata-containers uses this for AgentService and HealthService, (2) CSI interface implementations without Unimplemented embedding — uses a different code generation approach. These are separate enhancements, not bugs in the current linker."  # 833d
